-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/183931/183931.jpg\" alt=\"一棟貸切り　瀬の本テラス\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div class=\"flex-grow space-y-1\">\n        <h4 class=\"font-bold text-stone-900 text-sm leading-snug\">一棟貸切り　瀬の本テラス</h4>\n        <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-600\">熊本県阿蘇郡南小国町満願寺5621-90 ｜ 熊本空港より車で約８０分、ＪＲ　阿蘇駅より車で約４５分。</p>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-xs text-stone-700\">\n          \n          <span class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">目安: ¥9,800〜</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 bg-stone-50 p-2 rounded-lg border border-stone-100\">徒歩２分で阿蘇の大草原が広がる一棟貸切の宿。ＢＢＱセットの貸出があるので星空を見ながら楽しめます。</p>\n    <div class=\"text-right pt-1\">\n      <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D183931\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-5 py-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-xl shadow hover:opacity-95 transition\">\n        楽天トラベルでプラン・空室を見る ≫\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"p-4 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs space-y-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-3 items-center\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/188926/188926.jpg\" alt=\"グリッズプレミアムホテル熊本\" class=\"w-full md:w-36 h-24 object-cover rounded-xl shadow-inner flex-shrink-0\" />\n      <div clas